        "Hydrotalcite fractionation and acid oxygen correction unknown; bulk isotopes do not quantify microbial carbon. Separate PC-C respiration interpretation is not transferred.",
        "Section3.2 incorrectly refers HT-C to Figure5; Figure6 explicitly shows HT-C. Figure1 latitude caption North contradicts southern map. Goethite/gibbsite classified as Mg-Al silicates in source, not adopted.",
        "No directly measured age, formation conditions or industrial operation; separately cited dolomite/seawater synthesis not a new experiment in this paper."
      ]
    }
